% Nouns with semantic arguments (picture of Kim, edge of town). The ESD page
% gives no fingerprint; the query approximates with a noun predicate taking an
% ARG1.
%
% ERS fingerprint (https://delph-in.github.io/docs/erg/ErgSemantics_RelationalNouns/):
%   (no fingerprint on the ESD page)

pattern { N [pos="n"]; N -[1=ARG1]-> X }
